Current limitations define both the boundary conditions of this study and the development pathway toward zero-defect manufacturing. Single-view inspection cannot detect non-visible surface defects on complex geometries; binary classification forgoes defect type information relevant to root cause analysis; and the fixed  \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
