This study reported performance benchmarks for three YOLO architectures applied to industrial casting defect detection on a single controlled dataset of pump impeller castings. The results indicate that all three architectures can achieve detection performance comparable to accuracy levels typically reported for manual inspection in the literature, while operating at real-time throughput. YOLOv8s attained the highest classification performance with 99.9% precision and 100% recall (95% CI: 0.962−1.000); YOLOv5s achieved the highest throughput at 213 FPS; and YOLO11s provided the best localisation accuracy (mean IoU  \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
